  "project_description": "The Content Editing Message (content_editing_message) module allows you to add multiple messages to content and media forms with multiple displays options. \n\n The module has a configuration page in which this functionality can be applied to one (or more) content and media types. Addicionally you can configure:\n\n \n Title (translatable) \n Message and format (translatable) \n Style: info, warning, error or plain \n Weight: top, bottom or custom \n \n The configuration page can be found in /admin/config/content/messages .\n\n This module is compatible with Field Group module. Therefore if installed it will appear an extra option where you can input your field_group machine name (example: group_mytab ).",
